   "date",
   "The International Date Line runs right between them, so the Russian island is twenty-one hours ahead."
  ],
  [
   "nick",
   "Locals call them Tomorrow Island and Yesterday Island."
  ],
  [
   "ice",
   "In winter, the strait freezes. You could almost walk into tomorrow, but crossing is forbidden."
  ],
